      "id": "math-10-024",
      "number": 24,
      "question": "Cylinder diameter 4, height 14. CSA?",
      "options": {
        "A": "88",
        "B": "176",
        "C": "352",
        "D": "66"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "176 cm².",
      "hash": "6e2ff3a362d9b1c0",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "लंब वृत्तीय बेलन के आधार का व्यास 4 सेमी और ऊँचाई 14 सेमी है। वक्र पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल?",
          "options": {
            "A": "88",
            "B": "176",
            "C": "352",
            "D": "66"
          },
          "explanation": "r = 2। CSA = 2πrh = 2 × 22/7 × 2 × 14 = 44 × 4 = 176।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "math-10-025",
      "number": 25,
      "question": "Ratio of volumes of two spheres is 8:27. Ratio of radii?",
      "options": {
        "A": "2:3",
        "B": "4:9",
        "C": "8:27",
        "D": "1:3"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Cube root of 8:27 is 2:3.",
      "hash": "f394439ffd9a7be3",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि दो गोलों के आयतनों का अनुपात 8:27 है, तो उनकी त्रिज्याओं का अनुपात क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "2:3",
            "B": "4:9",
            "C": "8:27",
            "D": "1:3"
          },
          "explanation": "r₁³/r₂³ = 8/27 => r₁/r₂ = ∛(8/27) = 2/3।"
        }
      }
    },
